 [03] PREP - with the tables above in view, do these now:
 1. Is the physical interface listed at all - name, state=1 ACTIVE?
 If NOT: check its USB cable and power, replug it, watch [02c] change.
 2. Sound settings: make the INTERFACE the default playback device.
 The soak has no device picker - it always uses the default.
 3. Interface Properties, Advanced tab: tick BOTH
 ALLOW APPLICATIONS TO TAKE EXCLUSIVE CONTROL and
 GIVE EXCLUSIVE MODE APPLICATIONS PRIORITY. A driver reinstall
 resets these - this alone can explain every exclusive refusal.
 4. If [02a] shows a remote session still connected, log it off -
 Remote Audio endpoints survive sessions and steal the default.
 5. Power plan HIGH PERFORMANCE, sleep NEVER, other audio apps closed,
 monitors DOWN - several steps make sound.
 Note the sparq device INDEX of the interface - you will type it below.
 When done, press any key.
 is the interface now default, with exclusive control ticked [y/n]
 answer: Y
